{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38978","headline":"寄温州崔博士 · 杜荀鹤","name":"寄温州崔博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怀君劳我写诗情，窣窣阴风有鬼听。\n县宰不仁工部饿，酒家无识翰林醒。\n眼昏经史天何在，心尽英雄国未宁。\n好向贤侯话吟侣，莫教辜负少微星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}